#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Deform Brush is a brush that allows you to pull and push pixels around. "
"It's quite similar to the :ref:`liquify_mode`, but where liquify has higher "
"quality, the deform brush has the speed."
msgstr ""
"Čopič Deform je krtača, ki vam omogoča, da vlečete in potiskate piksle "
"naokoli. Precej podobno je :ref:'liquify_mode', kjer pa ima liquify višjo "
"kakovost, ima deformna krtača hitrost."

